  "authority": "Library of Congress / American Library Association, Pushto Romanization Table (2013 version; earlier 2012, 1997)",
  "description": "Library romanization of Pashto: ṭ ḍ ṛ ṇ for the retroflexes, ṡ ż for څ ځ, ẓh ṣh for ږ ښ, w for و, vowels a i u ā ī ū o e, diphthongs aw ay, ạy for ۍ/ۓ/final ئ, á for Arabic alif maqṣūrah, ʻ for ʿayn and ʼ for hamza, final h = -ah, article al- without assimilation, particle د = da.",
  "sources": ["https://www.loc.gov/catdir/cpso/romanization/pushto.pdf", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Afghan_name"],
  "notes": [
    "Vowel table: e is written for ې and for unvocalised final ی/ي (dre); ī needs a kasrah (or the lexicon), ay needs fatḥah + sukūn; ạy is written for ۍ, ۓ and final ئ (ḍoḍạy).",
    "Rule 13: an affix written separately (ZWNJ) is separated by a prime ʹ; note 2: the article al- keeps its l before sun letters (ʻAbd al-Rashīd, Niz̤ām al-Dīn).",
    "Rule 8(d): ۀ (Peshawar orthography) = ạh; the iẓāfah forms -i/-ʼi/-yi of rule 12 are generated only for a final kasrah.",
    "نړ is ṇ like ڼ. The values for ث ذ ط (s̱ ẕ t̤) were lost in PDF extraction and follow ALA-LC Urdu."
  ],
  "alphabet": "ءآأؤئابپتټثجچځڅحخدډذرړزژږسشښصضطظعغفقکګگلمنڼوهیيېۍ",
